    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106466" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρο-φάντης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>water-finder,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				99.21
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρο-φαντική</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>), ἡ, <i>the art of
				discovering water,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				2.6.1
			</span></i>; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρο-φαντικά</span></b> , τά, ibid.</div>
